⚡️🌍 Google has removed its new AI image generation feature for Google Earth just one day after launch, following the spread of realistic fake satellite images depicting missile attacks, explosions, and other disasters.

The company said it is rolling back the feature while it implements stronger safeguards, emphasizing that the AI-generated images were watermarked and never appeared as part of the official Google Earth imagery.

